File Browser 3
https://github.com/ToolsLib/filebrowser3

This project is a modified distribution of File Browser, based on upstream
File Browser v2.63.23, by the File Browser Contributors.
Upstream source: https://github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser

The upstream Apache License 2.0 and existing attribution notices are retained.
File Browser 3 is an independent ToolsLib fork, not an upstream File Browser
release. Changes include session and filesystem hardening, upload integrity,
dependency updates, a revised frontend, performance improvements and packaging.
The source history, CHANGELOG.md and docs/reviews document these modifications.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses and attribution
notices. Dependency versions are recorded in go.mod, go.sum and
frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml. This notice does not change those licenses.
